          "rule_title": "The Kubernetes Controller Manager must have secure binding.",
          "fix_text": "Edit the Kubernetes Controller Manager manifest file in the /etc/kubernetes/manifests directory on the Kubernetes Control Plane. Set the argument \"--bind-address\" to \"127.0.0.1\".",
          "weight": "10.0",
          "check_content": "Change to the /etc/kubernetes/manifests directory on the Kubernetes Control Plane. Run the command:\n\ngrep -i bind-address * \n\nIf the setting bind-address is not set to \"127.0.0.1\" or is not found in the Kubernetes Controller Manager manifest file, this is a finding.",
          "check_content_ref": {
            "href": "Kubernetes_STIG.xml",
            "name": "M"
